# Design System (Tailwind CSS v4)

## Tokens over magic values

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
<button className="rounded-cta bg-filled-dark px-6 py-2 text-filled-dark-fg">Confirmar</button>

// ❌ BAD
<button className="rounded-[26.5px] bg-[#2f2f2f] px-6 py-2 text-[#fafafa]">Confirmar</button>
```

## Key files

- `src/styles/tokens.css` — color/radius primitives as CSS variables
- `src/styles/global.css` — semantic mapping + `@theme inline` Tailwind wiring
- `DESIGN.md` — agent-readable token mirror (synced from loopops-web-app)
- `knowledge/design-system.md` — usage rules

## Primary color rule — MANDATORY

> **Primary action color is BLACK (filled-dark), not blue.**

Primary CTAs: `bg-filled-dark` + `text-filled-dark-fg`.
Blue (`bg-accent` / `text-accent`) is for links and brand accents only.
